      en: ["The MAFZ was established in 1991 on the grounds of a former state-owned livestock farm.", "The Arche livestock park is certified as an 'Arche-Park' by the GEH organization.", "The annual agricultural exhibition BRA_LA usually takes place in May.", "The site features a historic demonstration distillery.", "The park includes a water playground covering approximately 1,000 square meters.", "The glass-walled bakery produces bread according to local traditions in stone ovens."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1991 como centro de exposiciones y ocio.", "El recinto abarca una superficie total de unas 22 hectáreas.", "Alberga un parque de animales domésticos certificado con razas raras.", "Sede de la feria agrícola anual BraLa.", "Cuenta con una zona de juegos de agua de 500 m² para niños.", "El Brandenburghalle ofrece espacio para eventos con hasta 5.000 invitados."],
