      en: ["Covers 46 hectares in the Horn-Lehe district of Bremen", "Founded in 1933 to preserve botanical diversity", "Houses over 600 species and 3,500 varieties", "The Botanika science center opened on site in 2003", "Main flowering season is between April and June", "One of the largest collections of its kind in Europe"],
