      en: ["The site was founded in 1915 during the First World War.", "The largest manufacturer of ammonia and urea in all of Germany.", "A major producer of AdBlue for modern diesel engines.", "The industrial grounds in Wittenberg-Piesteritz cover around 220 hectares.", "Operates its own research center for application and agricultural technology.", "Feeds district heating to approx. 10,000 households from process waste heat."],
